# What the server reads of Gemini CLI's hook input (GeminiHookInput): the names as the host writes them. Of a model request only the model, not the conversation or the config.
# HostInputFieldsTest (sennard-personal) holds this file to the record, field for field.
session_id
cwd
transcript_path
source
reason
prompt
stop_hook_active
llm_request/model
tool_name
tool_input
mcp_context/server_name
mcp_context/tool_name
tool_response/llmContent
tool_response/error
